title: Take back the last commit
title-zh: 收回最近一次提交
---
# A recipes repository with two commits
> mkdir recipes
> cd recipes
> git init
+hidden README.md
# Family recipes

Recipes we cook again and again.
+end
> git add README.md
> git commit -m "Add a README"
+hidden pancakes.md
# Pancakes

- 200 g flour
- 2 eggs
- 300 ml milk
+end
> git add pancakes.md
> git commit -m "Add a pancake recipe"
+file pancakes.md
# Pancakes

- 200 g flour
- 2 eggs
- 300 ml milk
- a pinch of salt
+end
$ git commit -am "Add salt"
$ git reset --soft HEAD~1
$ git status
$ git commit -m "Add a pinch of salt to the pancakes"
$ git reset HEAD~1
$ git status
$ git log --oneline
